<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Balance Druid DPS Phase 2</h3>You want to fill in holes in your gear with items from the Conquest vendors. Items 1-4 are strong options with the remaining being lesser options.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45087/runed-orb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_runedorb_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Orb</span></a> has been added to the list for its use in crafted items or to sell for gold.<br/>
